                  "type": "string"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "Fetch-stream SSE: id is opaque resume_cursor; event is the RunEvent discriminator; canonical data is EventDelivery. Exact duplicates are deduplicated; conflicts/gaps stop application. Comment heartbeat has no id and cannot advance cursor.",
